#: scenario9:scenario9_3E50B9A6_CAE2_4F7F_8B64_AC4D3DF8CAE5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 992178afd4251769867f5f41bdef4cf3d6b190bf75c188f814c91b498e43d1b6
#. default-sha256: de250f3e2a2004458fd2cc9020f40f62658abe9e8cfd27500a435bae0e63f9e6
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_3E50B9A6_CAE2_4F7F_8B64_AC4D3DF8CAE5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was, as you ascertained, created by Morgana’s mind as it broke down in that tower."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Eu fui, como constatou, criada pela mente de Morgana quando ela quebrou naquela torre."

#: scenario9:scenario9_E4F254F0_79F2_42C0_A49A_1A604A14E118
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8ab5a84d6e6394125d9669ece354493c981be3209b9003bffab7f792d68e15a1
#. default-sha256: 095127f2978e1e8658f8202d2de23cfc60f401c94d6a132c788e89f9ba2d198a
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_E4F254F0_79F2_42C0_A49A_1A604A14E118"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The fact that she viewed herself as a saint only served to amplify that agony."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫O fato de ela se ver como uma santa só serviu para amplificar essa agonia."

#: scenario9:scenario9_19D976E8_DA0B_4502_90FC_4BD8611A2DAD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 66bd6a0066485c531db58e9122a1e6c52f360e429ce8f4f44e020f626a2e8005
#. default-sha256: 32cf1b9985550f7f755a08e3021256a8c1e145ccfd562d7142bcb775665a0824
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_19D976E8_DA0B_4502_90FC_4BD8611A2DAD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She wanted to hate them, but her identity would not allow her.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Those two "
"conflicting aspects of her self tore Morgana apart.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫She was unable to withstand it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ela queria odiá-los, mas sua identidade não lhe permitia.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Esses dois aspectos "
"conflitantes de seu eu destruíram Morgana.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Ela não conseguiu resistir."

#: scenario9:scenario9_20348580_23F0_480E_B537_06DE51FCD92D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 33aea3c971aa50a2ec0becb26df8c8124c3748014a057d013daca7d5efa0a658
#. default-sha256: 731273103015ab424e77afcd53b65d7188a37da5c32f480f6d26fe22389e3b7b
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_20348580_23F0_480E_B537_06DE51FCD92D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫When you came to the mansion and resurrected Morgana,⟪k:1⟫you resurrected me as well. ⟪k:2⟫"
"But I had no “self” at first."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quando veio para a mansão e ressuscitou Morgana,⟪k:1⟫você me ressuscitou também. ⟪k:2⟫Mas eu "
"não tinha um “eu” no início."

#: scenario9:scenario9_8F2F6F70_E9CD_4537_BD1D_4E10BA755ECD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 411245d5739473b1ec6c979a2dfc2b310d0558a95b91620ff8ca161cfe453257
#. default-sha256: c3bd5b84a926fb1ed494d48295a9556e83552117242b66441102d316864e174b
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_8F2F6F70_E9CD_4537_BD1D_4E10BA755ECD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was, I suppose, not much different than the particles of dust floating around the mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu não era, suponho, muito diferente das partículas de poeira flutuando ao redor da mansão."

#: scenario9:scenario9_345DE38B_7BBA_447C_85FD_38908279F629
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f0f2b29e1759d7c996bfebaee21b5ac7e9d10c122343d54337a7819725dc602f
