#: scenario9:scenario9_CDE192CC_D8E1_483D_ADDA_BF5B772FFBF8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a05c2495591b26af6292341bd9c20368af30b820d76358ab3b75afb76e7bb442
