msgstr "⟪k:0⟫que houvesse algo errado em querer viver."

#: scenario9:scenario9_427B61FA_F1B1_48B4_A6BF_CD32FDF16F18
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a74f0429720c21a3bdcc9df2fdb473cc9b53dfa89f5186b25b003f27669afed4
