msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Porque era ali que ela estava—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫a menina da qual fui formada."

#: scenario9:scenario9_13865182_DB1B_4F73_B3AA_181FDF2483F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
