#: scenario9:scenario9_CC95A959_3809_4FE9_AAC3_5963A5D0B1FE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e8c20f384b35a2221142b05860b74a0aa0ba4dec972b160d8bbcf67e3da5e605
